<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>It is by the life convincing</l><l>That the people may believe;</l><l>It is by the life imparting</l><l>That the souls may life receive.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Always in the Lord abiding,</l><l>As the branches fruit to bear;</l><l>By the inner life out-flowing</l><l>Christ with others we may share.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>May our living be the preaching,</l><l>Making Christ to others known;</l><l>Not the word of doctrine-preaching,</l><l>But the seed of life be sown.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
